<h3 nodeId="9cd09d67a12149d5a3300d845e095067">Step2:添加/更新多级路由场景</h3>
<km-note type="tip" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="36155ed31c8c43a48aabe1dbd29221b4">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="7e1bbf5ebc6a4c7aafd2d28498cdb747">关键概念说明：</p>
<p nodeId="0bcefb5102ec4ab3bc5a639448c12ffd">场景：多级路由的节点，场景是一组规则的集合</p>
<p nodeId="35e885b3269f4e1fb34d878596f32329">触发规则：当前仅当触发规则为“真”时，下一节点的场景才会被执行</p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
